{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mysterious dungeon in this dungeon-crawler RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Gobby, a small goblin wanting to find an exit from this seemingly infinite dungeon. But beware! Deadly traps, mad monsters, and even humans infest the labyrinth. Worse, it seems the place is only growing! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/ExplorationGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743853367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover 10 interconnected levels with classic grid-like controls. Walk, run, jump, swim, take stairs, and fall across different floors! Meet a varied cast of inhabitants and maybe make some friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/combat_spider.gif?t=1743853367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight with your dice in turn-based combat. Luck is not something you can rely on. Only your wits will lead you to victory. Unleash unstoppable combos using your dice and skills. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/inventory_new.gif?t=1743853367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crack open chests and discover powerful new dice to add to your arsenal. Trade items and abilities with the dungeon merchant. Build yourself a unique dice pool and unlock devastating skills! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 maps with verticality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ different types of roaming monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ unique items to customize your dice and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 possible endings to the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cast of charming characters in an impossible world </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Humble beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/7ac483629fd5eed74721509054271825a1ec6f4b.jpg"},{"name":"Mimic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/b672917dba6e1b47e39523195da635d82065c83c.jpg"},{"name":"Scary Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/14d26d0f9c2d86c9d34e3e001ec5e92c802b2dcc.jpg"},{"name":"SMASH!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/b6cd5ef8cb58929324850d2226d8010fac3fe4f6.jpg"},{"name":"It's on the box art!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/a368135001709f38d1fd8f9e9baac9e7f125cdfa.jpg"},{"name":"Farewell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/9dfc730776d6ce48dda12d06d75233d686570241.jpg"},{"name":"Cheesed to meet you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/c81756685e9ee6738695ebd453350c988ff8577a.jpg"},{"name":"The number of the beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/4a975fc0fdda21c502b6a948b6a24da3c6c26719.jpg"},{"name":"No Joker? Refund!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/edf5a81bf461ce0e366bc561eb7660e8b8112a35.jpg"},{"name":"Ghoulbusters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/a13ebba93c9e9a1b79e0f0681b1e32a8a6051cd8.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945950?t=1743853367","b